# --- Documentación interna (excepto README.md en la raíz) ---
Docs/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# --- Logs y temporales ---
logs/
*.log
*.err
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# --- IDE / editor / Cursor (reglas locales, no subir) ---
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
*.sublime-*

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

